Z||000000||Return of Fiero||10-25-2001||01:58 PM||||this is a repost,but, does anyone know what wires go to and from the starter on the 84 2M4? i need a good amout of info on this.<P>what I need:<BR>1. wire colors<BR>2. wire gages (thickness)<BR>3. location (where they go other than the starter or solenoid, and the teminal on the starter)<BR>4 location of any fusable links in the starter system, and the resistance on the fusable links.<P>please help, the harness will be here in a few days, and i cant do anything till i get the wires on the starter done<P>Myke||||reg||5
